virals.text:
Is prompt injection solved?

"NO" says our new @GoogleDeepMind paper: "Scaling Adaptive Prompt Injection Attacks with Agent Swarms" led by @alexey2004.

@GraySwanAI's human attacks are saturated, but automated red-teaming with Gemini 4 Argon can break most scenarios for recent

